  "body_html": "<p>Politicians do not control oil prices, including presidents. The free market decides.</p><p>Scrolling TikTok, I just saw Aaron Parnas report $150 a barrel as the target for oil. I guess this will be the <em><strong>easiest trade of our life! </strong></em>Load up now and we can all make an sweet 65% together!<strong> </strong></p><h3><strong>Stop </strong>🛑</h3><p>In 2022, President Joe Biden wanted oil prices below $71 a barrel.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> For the next 3 years…oil bears were teased with lower prices, but more than 90% of the time, the prices ranged between $71 and $85. It did not sustainably fall until 2025, when President Biden was out of office. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png\" width=\"1209\" height=\"858\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:858,&quot;width&quot;:1209,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:213760,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/190133968?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DBgQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2dc5b68b-d396-40b6-81be-b2c124629f0d_1209x858.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><strong>The point being: </strong>these narratives are incredibly misleading… DO NOT GET ATTACHED TO THE $150 PRICE TARGET THAT IS SPREADING LIKE WILDFIRE AMONGST RETAIL. I really wish Aaron would stop “covering” the markets, because he just regurgitates the mainstream media, which is notorious for damaging newer investors. I have never once, seen his market commentary, come to fruition. NOT ONCE. And this is no hate to Aaron…its just not his niche or skillset.</p><p><strong>I’m not saying oil can’t go up. I’m not saying you can’t make money. </strong></p><p>But what I am saying, is the $150 target is unlikely based on past experience of retail hype. What if they open the Strait of Hormuz for a day? Boom, your effed. Just <strong>have a plan </strong>if you intend to trade oil. We have seen these spikes repeatedly the last few years, and every time, it has reversed unexpectedly and crushed oil bulls. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>You may ask: “Well what would get you into oil?”</p><p>A: “The exact same setup I always play”</p><p>I would need to see that price action has held the 200 day moving average. Is within 25% of local highs. It has formed a local volatility contraction pattern. If you need a visual, it needs to look something like the below and note this is a hypothetical example, not drawn to scale. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png\" width=\"1222\" height=\"868\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/dce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:868,&quot;width&quot;:1222,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:157512,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/190133968?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MsjB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdce97260-288f-4bce-b160-52cd62651525_1222x868.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Oil simply needs to demonstrate stability and trend…NOT a short term moonshot due to retail speculation and mainstream media overhype. And to be honest, my long term estimate of $30…remains today. Yes, I know some of you short term degenerates are scoffing at me. I love you to. 🫶</p><p>Now, for the weekly wrap-up:</p><p>Very simple wrap up. I am writing this piece at 1:00 PM CST, so we still have 2 hours of market activity. <strong>Pending the market doesn’t violently reverse to the upside in that time,</strong> its been a very quiet week. I personally have not bought a stock since February 12th. When I see the markets are on fire…even a little fire…I am not going to throw more money at a market that is NOT working for me (or you!). Every single cycle, we see the “buy the dip” and the “DCA” crowd get spanked. Hard. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gHEs!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gHEs!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gHEs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gHEs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gHEs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png\" width=\"524\" height=\"132\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:132,&quot;width&quot;:524,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:18574,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/190133968?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gHEs!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gHEs!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gHEs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gHEs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F14596e3b-9781-4089-a4d3-f56894dc30ab_524x132.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Just preserving capital until the markets are favorable again, when trades work for us.</figcaption></figure></div><p>I am continuing to do nothing until market trends show life and strength to them. The VIX needs to come below 21, the S&amp;P 500 needs to break local highs, and we need to see individual names take off. That has not happened. Yet.</p><p>The only post worth checking out, if you missed it, is the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/ww3-stock-market-update\">“WW3” Stock Market Update</a> where I talk about the only assets to consider, if you are a short term trader is Gold, Silver, Oil, Oil Companies and Defense, posted on 02 March. Personally I am seeking a longer term portfolio for 2026, per the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a>, simply because the barrage of news is too tumultuous for me, and most people. </p><p>You will see some short term traders posting wins, and that is ok! Maybe they are really good. Just make sure they are not hiding large losses. But for now, I am just waiting to get into easier positions. You are always welcome to do whatever you want. </p><h4>Please like ❤️ and share this post. Its the only way to beat AI slop here on Substack.</h4><p>If you have questions, feel free to ping me in the main chat during market hours. Have a nice weekend: turn off the charts, turn off the news. Its so important, especially during a turbulent market to do a little mental cleanse and some self care (I sound like such a millenial/gen Z saying that LOL). But its true! Your mental state is an incredibly important aspect in your market decision making. Be fresh!</p><h4>The MARKETS WILL COME BACK TO LIFE. And it will happen when you least expect it. So stay tuned!</h4><p>Have a great weekend, and thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/president-biden-releases-more-oil-from-strategic-reserve-to-help-lower-gas-prices</p><p></p></div></div>",
